Required endpoints & behavior (FastAPI)

Admin
	•	POST /indices/create — create index (payload: index_name, source config for Mongo or Excel details, chunk_size, chunk_overlap). Starts initial build (async) and returns job id or 202.
	•	POST /indices/rebuild — full rebuild of index (sync immediately).
	•	POST /indices/sync — incremental sync using updated_at.
	•	POST /indices/create_from_excel — upload file or provide path & mapping.
	•	GET /indices — list indexes & metadata (doc_count, last_sync).
	•	GET /indices/{name}/status — returns status and path.

Search
	•	GET /search?index=<index>&q=<query>&top=N — return top N chunks with chunk_id, source_id, text, score, meta.

Health
	•	GET /health — uptime & status.

Admin endpoints require X-API-Key header; search and health are public.

