Indexing & storage rules (as before)
	•	Index dir: /data/indexes/<index_name>/
	•	registry.json per index with source_config, last_sync_time, doc_count.
	•	Chunking: chunk_text(text, chunk_size_words=500, overlap_words=50) with chunk_id <source_id>_c<chunk_idx>.
	•	Mongo incremental sync uses updated_at. If missing, schedule full rebuilds.
	•	Atomic swap for rebuilds: build to temp folder and rename.
	•	Lock during rebuild/sync.

⸻

Search behavior
	•	Whoosh + BM25 scoring to return top N results and stored metadata. Fallback to rank_bm25 if Whoosh not available.

